cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "snakemake_antibiotic_resistance: assembly, annotation and AMR gene detection in Staphylococcus aureus"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Snakemake pipeline (FastQC, SPAdes, QUAST, Prokka, Abricate)
  that assembles and annotates bacterial isolates and screens them for
  antimicrobial resistance and virulence genes, applied to three clinical
  Staphylococcus aureus isolates and the USA300_FPR3757 reference genome.
